WEBVTT

00:00:49.920 --> 00:00:51.400
JOY: Do you ever look
at someone and wonder...

00:00:51.680 --> 00:00:53.760
"What is going on inside their head?"

00:00:54.480 --> 00:00:57.520
Well, I know. Well, I know Riley's head.

00:01:03.320 --> 00:01:05.320
(BABY COOING)

00:01:33.760 --> 00:01:34.760
Hmm?

00:01:38.560 --> 00:01:39.800
(BABY COOING HAPPILY)

00:01:42.680 --> 00:01:44.720
JOY: And there she was...

00:01:46.520 --> 00:01:50.240
Hello. Riley.

00:01:50.960 --> 00:01:52.360
Oh, look at you.

00:01:52.960 --> 00:01:54.640
Aren't you a little bundle of joy?

00:01:57.080 --> 00:01:58.160
(BELL DINGS)

00:02:06.080 --> 00:02:07.920
Aren't you a little bundle of joy?

00:02:08.840 --> 00:02:10.080
Whoa.

00:02:25.120 --> 00:02:26.120
(RILEY COOING)

00:02:28.360 --> 00:02:32.880
JOY: It was amazing.
Just Riley and me. Forever.

00:02:36.120 --> 00:02:37.160
(RILEY CRYING)

00:02:39.520 --> 00:02:41.600
JOY: Er, for 33 seconds?

00:02:44.080 --> 00:02:45.600
I'm Sadness.

00:02:45.680 --> 00:02:48.960
Oh, hello. I... I'm Joy. So...

00:02:49.800 --> 00:02:51.280
Can I just... If you could...

00:02:51.360 --> 00:02:52.920
I just want to fix that. Thanks.

00:02:53.600 --> 00:02:55.200
JOY: And that was just the beginning.

00:02:55.440 --> 00:02:57.640
Headquarters only got
more crowded from there.

00:02:58.440 --> 00:02:59.560
(LAUGHING)

00:03:00.240 --> 00:03:03.200
Very nice. Okay, looks like
you got this. Very good.

00:03:03.320 --> 00:03:04.920
FEAR: Whoa, sharp turn!
No! Look out! No!

00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:06.000
JOY: That's Fear.

00:03:06.080 --> 00:03:08.160
He's really good at keeping Riley safe.

00:03:08.760 --> 00:03:10.000
FEAR: Easy, easy. Ah!

00:03:10.160 --> 00:03:12.000
(EXCLAIMS)
Oh, we're good. We're good.

00:03:13.240 --> 00:03:14.640
-Whew! Good job.
-Thank you. Thank you very much.

00:03:14.720 --> 00:03:16.160
-And we're back!
-(RILEY LAUGHING)

00:03:16.280 --> 00:03:18.240
-(GLASS SHATTERS)
-Oh!

00:03:20.840 --> 00:03:22.200
Here we go. All right, open.

00:03:22.480 --> 00:03:24.120
-Hmm. This looks new.
-You think it's safe?

00:03:24.200 --> 00:03:25.320
-What is it?
-Aah.

00:03:25.520 --> 00:03:28.200
Okay, caution.
There is a dangerous smell, people.

00:03:28.320 --> 00:03:30.360
-Hold on. What is that?
-JOY: This is Disgust.

00:03:30.480 --> 00:03:32.960
She basically keeps Riley
from being poisoned.

00:03:33.160 --> 00:03:34.320
Physically and socially.

00:03:34.480 --> 00:03:35.760
That is not brightly colored

00:03:35.840 --> 00:03:37.480
or shaped like a dinosaur.
Hold on, guys.

00:03:37.680 --> 00:03:38.920
It's broccoli! (EXCLAIMS IN DISGUST)

00:03:39.000 --> 00:03:40.000
Yucky!

00:03:41.920 --> 00:03:43.400
Well, I just saved our lives.

00:03:43.520 --> 00:03:44.680
-BOTH: Whew!
-Yeah. You're welcome.

00:03:44.800 --> 00:03:46.160
Riley, if you don't eat your dinner,

00:03:46.240 --> 00:03:47.600
you're not gonna get any dessert.

00:03:47.680 --> 00:03:50.000
Wait. Did he just say
we couldn't have dessert?

00:03:50.160 --> 00:03:51.240
JOY: That's Anger.

00:03:51.360 --> 00:03:54.440
He cares very deeply
about things being fair.

00:03:54.520 --> 00:03:56.360
So that's how you
want to play it, old man?

00:03:56.480 --> 00:03:59.400
No dessert? Oh, sure,
we'll eat our dinner!

00:03:59.640 --> 00:04:01.560
Right after you eat this!

00:04:01.680 --> 00:04:02.880
(YELLING)

00:04:03.280 --> 00:04:04.280
(YELLING)

00:04:05.040 --> 00:04:07.400
Riley, Riley, here comes an airplane!

00:04:07.520 --> 00:04:08.800
(MIMICS ENGINE HUMMING)

00:04:09.000 --> 00:04:11.360
Oh, airplane.
We got an airplane, everybody.

00:04:11.440 --> 00:04:12.600
-ALL: Oh!
-Airplane.

00:04:21.560 --> 00:04:24.880
JOY: And you've met Sadness.
She... Well, she...

00:04:24.960 --> 00:04:26.160
(CRYING)

00:04:29.400 --> 00:04:31.040
JOY: I'm not actually sure
what she does.

00:04:31.160 --> 00:04:32.400
And I've checked,

00:04:32.480 --> 00:04:33.760
there's no place for her to go, so...

00:04:33.880 --> 00:04:36.360
She's good, we're good. It's all great!

00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:38.920
Anyway, these are Riley's memories

00:04:39.040 --> 00:04:41.080
and they're mostly happy,
you'll notice. Not to brag.

00:04:41.240 --> 00:04:42.720
-MEG: Whoo-hoo!
-(RILEY LAUGHING)

00:04:44.080 --> 00:04:45.120
Whoo-hoo!

00:04:46.840 --> 00:04:48.760
JOY: But the really important ones
are over here.

00:04:49.240 --> 00:04:50.560
I don't want to get too technical,

00:04:50.680 --> 00:04:52.760
but these are called Core Memories.

00:04:53.240 --> 00:04:56.320
Each one came from
a super important time in Riley's life.

00:04:56.560 --> 00:04:58.200
Uh, like when she first scored a goal.

00:04:58.280 --> 00:04:59.720
Oh, that was so amazing!

00:04:59.840 --> 00:05:02.440
Hey! Would you look at that? Very nice!

00:05:02.560 --> 00:05:03.800
-We got a future center here!
-Nice job.

00:05:03.920 --> 00:05:05.200
(ALL CHEERING)

00:05:16.680 --> 00:05:17.920
JOY: And each Core Memory

00:05:18.040 --> 00:05:20.600
powers a different aspect
of Riley's personality.

00:05:21.080 --> 00:05:22.960
Like Hockey Island.

00:05:25.320 --> 00:05:27.440
Goofball Island is my personal favorite.

00:05:27.960 --> 00:05:29.960
Ah, come back here, you little monkey!

00:05:31.120 --> 00:05:33.000
DAD: (LAUGHING) Oh, you're silly.

00:05:33.120 --> 00:05:34.840
JOY: Yep, Goofball is the best.

00:05:35.280 --> 00:05:37.280
Friendship Island is pretty good too.

00:05:37.640 --> 00:05:38.920
(BOTH GIGGLING)

00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:42.320
JOY: Oh, I love Honesty Island.

00:05:42.520 --> 00:05:43.520
And that's the truth!

00:05:44.040 --> 00:05:46.080
And of course,
Family Island is amazing.

00:05:46.400 --> 00:05:47.920
(INDISTINCT)

00:05:48.520 --> 00:05:50.760
JOY: The point is,
the Islands of Personality

00:05:50.840 --> 00:05:52.880
are what make Riley...Riley!

00:05:53.200 --> 00:05:55.440
Look out, mermaid! (SPLASHING)

00:05:55.560 --> 00:05:56.800
(GIGGLING)

00:05:59.360 --> 00:06:00.400
(BUBBLING)

00:06:01.240 --> 00:06:02.720
Lava! Whee!

00:06:04.640 --> 00:06:06.400
♪ Who's your friend who likes to play?

00:06:06.480 --> 00:06:08.160
♪ Bing Bong, Bing Bong! ♪

00:06:08.840 --> 00:06:10.560
-Hey! Very nice!
-Where'd you learn that?

00:06:13.720 --> 00:06:15.800
(SLURPING) Ahhh!

00:06:15.880 --> 00:06:18.920
-Brain freeze!
-(ALL SCREAMING)

00:06:22.520 --> 00:06:24.680
-(CROWD CHEERING)
-Yeah!

00:06:28.240 --> 00:06:29.200
Good night, kiddo.

00:06:29.480 --> 00:06:30.520
Good night, Dad.

00:06:35.680 --> 00:06:38.480
And...we're out!

00:06:39.520 --> 00:06:40.760
JOY: That's what I'm talking about!

00:06:40.840 --> 00:06:42.280
Whoo! Another perfect day!

00:06:42.400 --> 00:06:43.560
Nice job, everybody!

00:06:43.680 --> 00:06:45.120
Let's get those memories
down to Long Term.

00:06:50.640 --> 00:06:52.240
All right, we did not die today!

00:06:52.400 --> 00:06:54.160
I call that an unqualified success.

